      </p>
      <p>
        <inline name="agenda item name">Review of the efficiency of the administrative and financial functioning of the United Nations</inline>
      </p>
      <p>
        <docTitle>Resolution adopted by the General Assembly on 30 June 2026</docTitle>
      </p>
      <p xml:space="preserve">
        <docProponent refersTo="#fifthCommittee">[on the report of the Fifth Committee (<inline name="originating document">A/80/568/Add.2, para. 15</inline>)]</docProponent>
